  unitName: Dragon Scroll Kagura
  unitId: 40596
  unitNumber: 989
  description: A kunoichi from another world. Though she defeated many a demon in
    Ishgria, Kagura was unable to find the girl she was hunting down. But one day,
    she sensed a disturbance caused by an opening void, and thus headed towards it.
    The void had already disappeared by the time she had arrived, but in its stead
    she found pieces of a blood-stained kimono and some scraps of armor, as well
    as an ancient scroll from her village. Assuming her target had already been eliminated,
    she reclaimed the scroll and vowed to reach an even higher level of power.
  summonDesc: I don't think real freedom exists. Someone's always going to selfishly
    ask me to do their bidding.
  fusionDesc: Becoming stronger is a pain. Everyone expects so much from you... But
    I haven't changed my mind.
  evoDesc: Now I understand what he meant... The secrets behind the elegant art of
    illusion lie within me!
  element: 4
  rarity: 6
